---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Docker Sandboxes (sbx) compatible agent sandboxes on smolvm microVMs

Usage: sbt [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  run         Create a sandbox if needed and attach to its agent
  create      Create and start a sandbox
  exec        Run a command in a sandbox
  ls          List sandboxes
  start       Start stopped sandboxes
  stop        Stop sandboxes, keeping their state
  rm          Remove sandboxes
  prune       Remove stopped sandboxes
  reset       Remove every sandbox and smolbento's session state
  cp          Copy files between the host and a sandbox
  fork        Copy a running sandbox (memory, processes, disk) for parallel attempts
  version     Show smolbento and smolvm versions
  completion  Generate shell completions
  diagnose    Check smolbento's environment
  settings    Read and change settings
  daemon      Accepted for sbx compatibility; smolbento needs no daemon
  ports       Publish or unpublish ports on a sandbox (127.0.0.1 only)
  policy      Network policy
  secret      Secrets for agents: sandboxes see placeholders, smolvm sends the real value
  kit         Inspect, validate and add kits
  mcp         MCP servers (not implemented yet)
  env         Manage a sandbox declared in an sbxenv.yaml file
  template    Sandbox templates (not implemented yet)
  skills      Agent skills (not implemented yet)
  setup       SSH access (not implemented yet)
  tui         Dashboard (not implemented yet)
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
